    "body": "Bumps [@angular/common](https://github.com/angular/angular/tree/HEAD/packages/common), [@angular/forms](https://github.com/angular/angular/tree/HEAD/packages/forms), [@angular/platform-browser](https://github.com/angular/angular/tree/HEAD/packages/platform-browser), [@angular/platform-browser-dynamic](https://github.com/angular/angular/tree/HEAD/packages/platform-browser-dynamic) and [@angular/router](https://github.com/angular/angular/tree/HEAD/packages/router). These dependencies needed to be updated together.\nUpdates `@angular/common` from 12.2.16 to 22.2.3\n<details>\n<summary>Release notes</summary>\n<p><em>Sourced from <a href=\"https://github.com/angular/angular/releases\">@​angular/common's releases</a>.</em></p>\n<blockquote>\n<h2>22.2.3</h2>\n<h3>common</h3>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>Commit</th>\n<th>Description</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody>\n<tr>\n<td><a href=\"https://github.com/angular/angular/commit/fafec77b5d4e6dfc89aad72db9c132d3dfe46ba6\"><img src=\"https://img.shields.io/badge/fafec77b5d-fix-green\" alt=\"fix - fafec77b5d\" /></a></td>\n<td>harden param encoding against prototype pollution</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody>\n</table>\n<h3>compiler</h3>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>Commit</th>\n<th>Description</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody>\n<tr>\n<td><a href=\"https://github.com/angular/angular/commit/54f3de517c2e4cda264eca5f2d143a1f6967c7a9\"><img src=\"https://img.shields.io/badge/54f3de517c-fix-green\" alt=\"fix - 54f3de517c\" /></a></td>\n<td>check <code>@boundary</code> blocks in the control flow content projection diagnostic</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><a href=\"https://github.com/angular/angular/commit/5e50658fd23983dd27ef89a67cea26910af6fd79\"><img src=\"https://img.shields.io/badge/5e50658fd2-fix-green\" alt=\"fix - 5e50658fd2\" /></a></td>\n<td>compare the operand in ReadTemporaryExpr.isEquivalent</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><a href=\"https://github.com/angular/angular/commit/b6f9cc5d7013f8f136b38cccfe486264200f04f5\"><img src=\"https://img.shields.io/badge/b6f9cc5d70-fix-green\" alt=\"fix - b6f9cc5d70\" /></a></td>\n<td>do not scope comments placed inside of a selector</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><a href=\"https://github.com/angular/angular/commit/35a02f8097724f4b6e83e1c9c008da8f1fc7f127\"><img src=\"https://img.shields.io/badge/35a02f8097-fix-green\" alt=\"fix - 35a02f8097\" /></a></td>\n<td>harden JIT against prototype pollution</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><a href=\"https://github.com/angular/angular/commit/08075e8aa03800bc1b8ae793fb3d52761cdd28b6\"><img src=\"https://img.shields.io/badge/08075e8aa0-fix-green\" alt=\"fix - 08075e8aa0\" /></a></td>\n<td>support dots in class binding names</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><a href=\"https://github.com/angular/angular/commit/c7a72c2bf2213d881496e70933fc61bdaaa00621\"><img src=\"https://img.shields.io/badge/c7a72c2bf2-fix-green\" alt=\"fix - c7a72c2bf2\" /></a></td>\n<td>support popover property bindings</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody>\n</table>\n<h3>compiler-cli</h3>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>Commit</th>\n<th>Description</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody>\n<tr>\n<td><a href=\"https://github.com/angular/angular/commit/fa21d083fe92e67a2a070059b850b9a32a08cef9\"><img src=\"https://img.shields.io/badge/fa21d083fe-fix-green\" alt=\"fix - fa21d083fe\" /></a></td>\n<td>inline tcb when depending on local directive</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody>\n</table>\n<h3>core</h3>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>Commit</th>\n<th>Description</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody>\n<tr>\n<td><a href=\"https://github.com/angular/angular/commit/b5208f9fc3a77a9631c2f38c30c38c777a642839\"><img src=\"https://img.shields.io/badge/b5208f9fc3-fix-green\" alt=\"fix - b5208f9fc3\" /></a></td>\n<td>avoid deleting idle bucket created during another bucket's drain</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><a href=\"https://github.com/angular/angular/commit/90af679c3b585515651b138667b8eaf3df652968\"><img src=\"https://img.shields.io/badge/90af679c3b-fix-green\" alt=\"fix - 90af679c3b\" /></a></td>\n<td>do not swallow compilation errors in computeStandaloneComponentScope</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><a href=\"https://github.com/angular/angular/commit/eca5fa466508ef68014cbebb0cafd63947f9eda7\"><img src=\"https://img.shields.io/badg…",
